3. Excessive Access to Stored Procedures
Check
select name
from sysobjects
where type='P'

Then test:

exec proc_name

or

sp_helptext proc_name
Vulnerable If

You can execute procedures intended for administrators.

Finding

Excessive Stored Procedure Execution Permissions

4. Access to System Databases

Check access to:

use master
go

select top 10 * from syslogins
select top 10 * from sysprocesses
select top 10 * from sysdatabases
Finding

Unauthorized Access to System Database Information

5. Cross-Database Access Review

You already have visibility to 38 databases.

Test:

use cdaccess
go

select top 10 name
from sysobjects
use admin
go

select top 10 name
from sysobjects
Vulnerable If

You can read business data outside your approved database.

